@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `cstd-nouns`

-- Builders for the named cases the tests modules use. No rules and no assertions: L4 has no
-- record update, so each builder takes the facts a test varies and fixes the rest at a value
-- stated beside it. Every fixed value is a plain case fact, not a figure from the terms.

§ `Test fixtures`

-- An individual policyholder of full capacity, living in Vietnam.
`an adult policyholder` MEANS `an individual` (YMD 1980 1 1) TRUE TRUE

-- A contract issued and effective on the same day, premium term to the 15th anniversary.
GIVEN eff IS A DATE
      dob IS A DATE
      sx  IS A `A sex`
GIVETH A `The contract`
`a contract effective` eff `for an insured born` dob `of sex` sx MEANS
    `The contract` WITH
        `issue date`                IS eff
        `effective date`            IS eff
        `latest reinstatement date` IS NOTHING
        `premium term`              IS `to the 15th policy anniversary`
        `insured`                   IS `The insured` WITH `date of birth` IS dob, `sex` IS sx
        `policyholder`              IS `an adult policyholder`

-- The same, with an issue date, a reinstatement and a premium term of the test's choosing.
GIVEN issue IS A DATE
      eff   IS A DATE
      reins IS A MAYBE DATE
      term  IS A `A premium term`
      dob   IS A DATE
      sx    IS A `A sex`
GIVETH A `The contract`
`a contract issued` issue `effective` eff `reinstated` reins `with a premium term` term `for an insured born` dob `of sex` sx MEANS
    `The contract` WITH
        `issue date`                IS issue
        `effective date`            IS eff
        `latest reinstatement date` IS reins
        `premium term`              IS term
        `insured`                   IS `The insured` WITH `date of birth` IS dob, `sex` IS sx
        `policyholder`              IS `an adult policyholder`

-- C1: effective and issued 1 January 2020; a woman born 1 July 1985, of 34 Tuổi at the
-- effective date (her 35th birthday falls after it).
`C1` MEANS `a contract effective` (YMD 2020 1 1) `for an insured born` (YMD 1985 7 1) `of sex` `female`
-- C1m: the same for a man.
`C1m` MEANS `a contract effective` (YMD 2020 1 1) `for an insured born` (YMD 1985 7 1) `of sex` `male`

-- A diagnosis, every fact a test can vary given, the rest as stated: the person diagnosed
-- is the insured; one visit (number 1); certified as meeting the qualitative part of the
-- definition; no qualitative alternative; first examined by a doctor on the day of
-- diagnosis; not declared as pre-existing; no suicide, crime or nuclear cause.
GIVEN cond   IS A `A listed condition`
      dx     IS A DATE
      first  IS A DATE
      ms     IS A LIST OF `A measurement`
      acts   IS A LIST OF `An activity of daily living`
      alt    IS A BOOLEAN
      causes IS A LIST OF `A cause`
      death  IS A MAYBE DATE
      acc    IS A MAYBE `An accident`
GIVETH A `A diagnosis`
`a diagnosis of` cond `on` dx `, first sign` first `, measured` ms `, unable to do` acts `, alternative` alt `, causes` causes `, death` death `, accident` acc MEANS
    `A diagnosis` WITH
        `the condition`                                          IS cond
        `the person diagnosed`                                   IS `the insured person`
        `date of diagnosis`                                      IS dx
        `date of the first sign, symptom, diagnosis or treatment` IS first
        `the visit`                                              IS 1
        `the paired organ`                                       IS NOTHING
        `the accident causing it`                                IS acc
        `the measurements`                                       IS ms
        `the activities of daily living the insured cannot perform` IS acts
        `the qualitative alternative certified`                  IS alt
        `the rest of the definition certified as met`            IS TRUE
        `the causes`                                             IS causes
        `date a doctor first examined, diagnosed or treated it`  IS dx
        `declared and accepted by the Company`                   IS FALSE
        `suicide, an act of suicide or a self-inflicted injury`  IS FALSE
        `a criminal act causing it`                              IS NOTHING
        `nuclear, chemical or radioactive cause`                 IS FALSE
        `date of death of the insured`                           IS death

-- The everyday case: first sign on the day of diagnosis, no ADL loss, no alternative, no
-- excluded cause, alive, no accident.
GIVEN cond IS A `A listed condition`
      dx   IS A DATE
      ms   IS A LIST OF `A measurement`
GIVETH A `A diagnosis`
`a plain diagnosis of` cond `on` dx `measuring` ms MEANS
    `a diagnosis of` cond `on` dx `, first sign` dx `, measured` ms `, unable to do` EMPTY `, alternative` FALSE `, causes` EMPTY `, death` NOTHING `, accident` NOTHING

-- A diagnosis for 13.4, of the person given, with the qualitative alternative certified.
GIVEN cond   IS A `A listed condition`
      who    IS A `A person diagnosed`
      dx     IS A DATE
      ms     IS A LIST OF `A measurement`
GIVETH A `A diagnosis`
`a diagnosis for 13.4 of` cond `in` who `on` dx `measuring` ms MEANS
    `A diagnosis` WITH
        `the condition`                                          IS cond
        `the person diagnosed`                                   IS who
        `date of diagnosis`                                      IS dx
        `date of the first sign, symptom, diagnosis or treatment` IS dx
        `the visit`                                              IS 1
        `the paired organ`                                       IS NOTHING
        `the accident causing it`                                IS NOTHING
        `the measurements`                                       IS ms
        `the activities of daily living the insured cannot perform` IS EMPTY
        `the qualitative alternative certified`                  IS TRUE
        `the rest of the definition certified as met`            IS TRUE
        `the causes`                                             IS EMPTY
        `date a doctor first examined, diagnosed or treated it`  IS dx
        `declared and accepted by the Company`                   IS FALSE
        `suicide, an act of suicide or a self-inflicted injury`  IS FALSE
        `a criminal act causing it`                              IS NOTHING
        `nuclear, chemical or radioactive cause`                 IS FALSE
        `date of death of the insured`                           IS NOTHING

-- A diagnosis with one of the 19.2 facts or the 1.19 facts set.
GIVEN cond    IS A `A listed condition`
      dx      IS A DATE
      ms      IS A LIST OF `A measurement`
      examined IS A DATE
      declared IS A BOOLEAN
      selfharm IS A BOOLEAN
      crime    IS A MAYBE `A criminal act`
      nuclear  IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A diagnosis`
`a diagnosis of` cond `on` dx `measuring` ms `, first examined` examined `, declared` declared `, self-harm` selfharm `, crime` crime `, nuclear` nuclear MEANS
    `A diagnosis` WITH
        `the condition`                                          IS cond
        `the person diagnosed`                                   IS `the insured person`
        `date of diagnosis`                                      IS dx
        `date of the first sign, symptom, diagnosis or treatment` IS dx
        `the visit`                                              IS 1
        `the paired organ`                                       IS NOTHING
        `the accident causing it`                                IS NOTHING
        `the measurements`                                       IS ms
        `the activities of daily living the insured cannot perform` IS EMPTY
        `the qualitative alternative certified`                  IS FALSE
        `the rest of the definition certified as met`            IS TRUE
        `the causes`                                             IS EMPTY
        `date a doctor first examined, diagnosed or treated it`  IS examined
        `declared and accepted by the Company`                   IS declared
        `suicide, an act of suicide or a self-inflicted injury`  IS selfharm
        `a criminal act causing it`                              IS crime
        `nuclear, chemical or radioactive cause`                 IS nuclear
        `date of death of the insured`                           IS NOTHING

-- A diagnosis at a given visit, of a given paired organ.
GIVEN cond  IS A `A listed condition`
      dx    IS A DATE
      visit IS A NUMBER
      organ IS A MAYBE `A paired organ`
      ms    IS A LIST OF `A measurement`
GIVETH A `A diagnosis`
`a diagnosis of` cond `on` dx `at visit` visit `, organ` organ `, measuring` ms MEANS
    `A diagnosis` WITH
        `the condition`                                          IS cond
        `the person diagnosed`                                   IS `the insured person`
        `date of diagnosis`                                      IS dx
        `date of the first sign, symptom, diagnosis or treatment` IS dx
        `the visit`                                              IS visit
        `the paired organ`                                       IS organ
        `the accident causing it`                                IS NOTHING
        `the measurements`                                       IS ms
        `the activities of daily living the insured cannot perform` IS EMPTY
        `the qualitative alternative certified`                  IS FALSE
        `the rest of the definition certified as met`            IS TRUE
        `the causes`                                             IS EMPTY
        `date a doctor first examined, diagnosed or treated it`  IS dx
        `declared and accepted by the Company`                   IS FALSE
        `suicide, an act of suicide or a self-inflicted injury`  IS FALSE
        `a criminal act causing it`                              IS NOTHING
        `nuclear, chemical or radioactive cause`                 IS FALSE
        `date of death of the insured`                           IS NOTHING

-- An earlier payment under Article 13.
GIVEN cond  IS A `A listed condition`
      amt   IS A NUMBER
      dx    IS A DATE
      visit IS A NUMBER
      organ IS A MAYBE `A paired organ`
      same  IS A BOOLEAN
      appr  IS A DATE
GIVETH A `A critical illness benefit already paid`
`a payment for` cond `of` amt `, diagnosed` dx `at visit` visit `, organ` organ `, same illness` same `, approved` appr MEANS
    `A critical illness benefit already paid` WITH
        `the condition`                     IS cond
        `the amount`                        IS amt
        `date of diagnosis`                 IS dx
        `the visit`                         IS visit
        `the paired organ`                  IS organ
        `for the same illness as the claim` IS same
        `date the Company approved it`      IS appr

-- A claim: in force at the diagnosis, decided 60 days after it, nothing paid under other
-- contracts, no coupon approved; the earlier payments and the conditions ever claimed given.
GIVEN c       IS A `The contract`
      d       IS A `A diagnosis`
      sa      IS A NUMBER
      paid    IS A LIST OF `A critical illness benefit already paid`
      claimed IS A LIST OF `A listed condition`
GIVETH A `A critical illness claim`
`a claim under` c `for` d `on a sum insured of` sa `, after the payments` paid `, the claims made being` claimed MEANS
    `A critical illness claim` WITH
        `the contract`                                         IS c
        `the diagnosis`                                        IS d
        `sum insured at the date of diagnosis`                 IS sa
        `the contract in force at the date of diagnosis`       IS TRUE
        `the benefits already paid`                            IS paid
        `the conditions claimed under the contract`            IS claimed
        `paid for this diagnosis under the insured's other contracts` IS 0
        `date the Company approved the comfort cash coupon`     IS NOTHING
        `date the claim is decided`                            IS (d's `date of diagnosis`) PLUS 60

-- The first claim under the contract: nothing paid, this the only condition claimed.
GIVEN c  IS A `The contract`
      d  IS A `A diagnosis`
      sa IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A critical illness claim`
`a first claim under` c `for` d `on a sum insured of` sa MEANS
    `a claim under` c `for` d `on a sum insured of` sa `, after the payments` EMPTY `, the claims made being` (LIST (d's `the condition`))

-- A claim with every field given.
GIVEN c       IS A `The contract`
      d       IS A `A diagnosis`
      sa      IS A NUMBER
      inforce IS A BOOLEAN
      paid    IS A LIST OF `A critical illness benefit already paid`
      other   IS A NUMBER
      coupon  IS A MAYBE DATE
      decided IS A DATE
GIVETH A `A critical illness claim`
`a full claim under` c `for` d `on` sa `, in force` inforce `, paid` paid `, other contracts` other `, coupon approved` coupon `, decided` decided MEANS
    `A critical illness claim` WITH
        `the contract`                                         IS c
        `the diagnosis`                                        IS d
        `sum insured at the date of diagnosis`                 IS sa
        `the contract in force at the date of diagnosis`       IS inforce
        `the benefits already paid`                            IS paid
        `the conditions claimed under the contract`            IS LIST (d's `the condition`)
        `paid for this diagnosis under the insured's other contracts` IS other
        `date the Company approved the comfort cash coupon`     IS coupon
        `date the claim is decided`                            IS decided

-- A death claim, the varying facts given; no premium after death, no post-death benefit.
GIVEN c        IS A `The contract`
      death    IS A DATE
      cause    IS A `The cause of a death`
      inforce  IS A BOOLEAN
      sa       IS A NUMBER
      divs     IS A NUMBER
      interest IS A NUMBER
      debt     IS A NUMBER
      funeral  IS A NUMBER
      premiums IS A NUMBER
      late     IS A MAYBE DATE
      cap      IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A `A death claim`
`a death claim under` c `on` death `by` cause `, in force` inforce `, sum insured` sa `, dividends` divs `, interest` interest `, debt` debt `, funeral advanced` funeral `, premiums` premiums `, late stage decided` late `, funeral cap` cap MEANS
    `A death claim` WITH
        `the contract`                                         IS c
        `date of death`                                        IS death
        `the cause`                                            IS cause
        `the contract in force at the date of death`           IS inforce
        `sum insured at the date of death`                     IS sa
        `accumulated dividends`                                IS divs
        `accumulated interest`                                 IS interest
        `premiums paid after the date of death`                IS 0
        `the debt`                                             IS debt
        `funeral benefit already paid`                         IS funeral
        `benefits arising after the death already paid`        IS 0
        `total premiums paid`                                  IS premiums
        `benefits paid under the contract before the death`    IS 0
        `surrender value at the date of death`                 IS 0
        `date the Company decided to pay the late-stage benefit` IS late
        `comfort cash coupons and interest held`               IS 0
        `the funeral cap fixed by the Business Procedures`     IS cap

`a natural cause` MEANS `The cause of a death` WITH
    `date of an act of suicide causing it` IS NOTHING
    `a criminal act causing it`            IS NOTHING

-- An accident satisfying 1.17, on the given days.
GIVEN ev  IS A DATE
      inj IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `An accident`
`an accident on` ev `, injuring on` inj MEANS
    `An accident` WITH
        `date of the event`                                              IS ev
        `an objective event of a sudden external force or object on the body` IS TRUE
        `the direct and sole cause, unrelated to any other cause`        IS TRUE
        `date of the injury or death`                                    IS inj
